on wednesday president joe biden  announced what could be the biggest  round of student loan forgiveness of his  presidency the new relief forgives up to  20 thousand dollars in student loans for  individuals who qualified for federal  pell grants for low-income first-time  college students  there will also be ten thousand dollars  in relief for all other federal student  loan borrowers both of these offers are  subject to income caps  one hundred twenty five thousand dollars  for individuals and two hundred fifty  thousand dollars for households  14.6 million borrowers had 10 000 or  less in federal student loan debt as of  the end of june and are in line to have  all of their debt forgiven if they fall  below the income cap  this represents roughly a third of all  borrowers the policy will also erase at  least half of student loan debt held by  the twenty point five percent of  borrowers who owe between ten thousand  dollars and twenty thousand dollars in  addition it will take a significant  chunk out of the twenty thousand dollars  to forty thousand dollars owed by  another twenty one point four percent of  borrowers targeting pell grant  recipients is seen as a way to address  concerns that blanket forgiveness could  disproportionately benefit wealthier  americans according to the federal  reserve the top 10 percent of americans  by income holds 17.4 percent of all  student loan debt  despite the 125 000 income cap research  shows the white house plan still  slightly favors higher income americans  analysis of a ten thousand dollar  blanket relief program published tuesday  by the penn wharton budget model found  69.79  of overall debt forgiveness would go to  the top 60 percent of americans by  income the biden administration has  already forgiven about 32 billion  dollars in student loan debt prior to  wednesday through measures targeting  borrowers who were misled by their  colleges and those who qualified for a  previously obscure public service worker  program biden also announced that the  moratorium on federal student loan  repayments will end december 31st 2022  you
 

